        "text": "Obavia (https://obavia.co) is sales operating software, in development, founded by Jason Obawemimo, for agency owners generating $100,000 to $1,000,000 a month and their own setters and closers. It works inside the agency's own funnel, SOPs and vocabulary, and follows a sale in six stages: Capture (the inquiry becomes a lead), Connect (one owner, the buyer's exact words), Book (a call with a clear purpose), Discover (fit, from what actually happened), Agree (the buyer's words reach the closer), and Collect (cash, counted when verified). Tagline: \"Hear what clients really mean. Carry it from the first call to collected cash.\""
